:"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2025-03-12T00:25:45Z","updated_at":"2025-03-23T00:13:13Z","closed_at":"2025-03-23T00:09:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis issue effects Godot 4.3 and 4.4 on Linux based systems using Godot's Forward+ renderer. \n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint 21.1. AMD 5700x, Nvidia 3070ti. Issue effects Godot 4.3 and 4.4 .\n\n### Issue description\n\nRunning a 2D Godot application will case a display jitter or shudder about every second when using the Forward+ renderer on Linux.  I think this issue is related to an [open issue ](https://github.com/orgs/godotengine/projects/78/views/3?filterQuery=status%3A%22For+team+assessment%22+forward&pane=issue&itemId=90874045&issue=godotengine%7Cgodot%7C84137) here.  I am interested in if there is a fix in the works for the Forward+ renderer regarding this issue as the issue has existed for quite awhile. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRunning a 2D Godot 4.3 or 4.4 application will case a display jitter or shudder about every second when using the Forward+ renderer on Linux. Using the compatibility renderer works fine with no jitter visible in the display. I have included a small video showing the jitter while testing my 2D project with Godot 4.4. This project runs fine with the OpenGL compatibility renderer.  \n\n\n*** I have found that setting MaxFPS to 60 (using 60hrtz monitors) and disabling vsync fixes the issue with nearly no jitter.\n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0a1d6b7-c5e5-43f8-a0c0-a001eaec2fef\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSimply run a 2D Godot application using the Forward+ renderer on Linux.","closed_by":{"login":"RichardBetson","id":656713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NjcxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/656713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson","html_url":"https://github.com/RichardBetson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RichardBetson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104001/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}